# Used by the images whose build context is the repository root (the
# vulnerability connector, the honeypot shipper and the network inventory).
# Nothing but their source files is sent to Docker, so secrets, certificates
# and fetched upstream code never enter the build. A file an image copies must
# be listed here; scripts/verify.sh repo checks that.
*
!ticketing/forwarder/td_forwarder.py
!vulnerability/connector/td_vuln
!vulnerability/connector/td_vuln/*.py
!honeypot/shipper/td_honeypot.py
!network/app/td_net
!network/app/td_net/*.py
**/__pycache__
